,  menemukan  makanan  bukan", "nar": "Namun, menemukan makanan bukan"}, {"i": 47, "ts": "3:19", "t": 199.14, "score": 1, "heard": " aman.  Disekitar  sungai,  berbagai", "nar": "Di sekitar sungai, berbagai"}, {"i": 48, "ts": "3:23", "t": 203.42, "score": 3, "heard": " Pada  zaman  itu,  Jawa", "nar": "Pada zaman itu, Jawa"}, {"i": 49, "ts": "3:29", "t": 208.74, "score": 3, "heard": " serta  badak,  rusah,  dan", "nar": "serta badak, rusa, dan"}, {"i": 50, "ts": "3:32", "t": 212.26, "score": 3, "heard": " Sebagian  memiliki  ukuran  tubuh", "nar": "Sebagian memiliki ukuran tubuh"}, {"i": 51, "ts": "3:36", "t": 215.12, "score": 3, "heard": " Bertemu  hewan  besar  dari", "nar": "Bertemu hewan besar dari"}, {"i": 52, "ts": "3:39", "t": 219.4, "score": 3, "heard": " terutama  jika  hewan  itu", "nar": "terutama jika hewan itu"}, {"i": 53, "ts": "3:42", "t": 222.2, "score": 3, "heard": " Di  perairan,  bahaya  lain", "nar": "Di perairan, bahaya lain"}, {"i": 54, "ts": "3:45", "t": 225.36, "score": 3, "heard": " Seekor  buaya  mungkin  bersembunyi", "nar": "Seekor buaya mungkin bersembunyi"}, {"i": 55, "ts": "3:51", "t": 231.14, "score": 3, "heard": " Karena  itu,  tempat  yang", "nar": "Karena itu, tempat yang"}, {"i": 56, "ts": "3:57", "t": 237.38, "score": 3, "heard": " Namun,  Homo  erectus  memiliki", "nar": "Namun, Homo Erectus memiliki"}, {"i": 57, "ts": "4:03", "t": 242.68, "score": 3, "heard": " Mereka  mampu  menggunakan  teralatan.", "nar": "Mereka mampu menggunakan peralatan."}, {"i": 58, "ts": "4:05", "t": 245.92, "score": 3, "heard": " Salah  satu  teknologi  yang", "nar": "Salah satu teknologi yang"}, {"i": 59, "ts": "4:10", "t": 250.44, "score": 3, "heard": " Cara  membuatnya  tampak  sederhana.", "nar": "Cara membuatnya tampak sederhana."}, {"i": 60, "ts": "4:13", "t": 252.56, "score": 3, "heard": " Sebuah  batu  dipukul  menggunakan", "nar": "Sebuah batu dipukul menggunakan"}, {"i": 61, "ts": "4:18", "t": 258.42, "score": 3, "heard": " Pecahan  tersebut